<title>GERMANY: German grain trade seeks intvn rye export.</title>
<headline>German grain trade seeks intvn rye export.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders bid for 102,600 tonnes of intervention rye exports to third countries, state grain intervention board BLE said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bids will be assessed by the EU Cereals Management Committee at a weekly meeting later on today.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
